    "setup": "Pool=15, everything else default. Drive /api/db at 50 users. The pool is smaller than the healthy baseline (20) but not small enough to cause queuing: pending will be near zero, acquire fast, p99 inside the SLA with a narrow margin. The pool utilisation peak will be higher than the healthy baseline -- more of the pool is used -- but no threshold is breached.\n",
